{"title":"Career Roadmap · NGT Litigator","role":"NGT Litigator","summary":"An NGT Litigator is a legal professional who handles environmental disputes and related proceedings before the National Green Tribunal (NGT) and, where appropriate, connected proceedings before constitutional courts and other authorities.","facts":{"Current degree":"Law - LLB / BA LLB / BBA LLB / B.Com LLB / B.Sc LLB (Integrated)","Course":"Environmental Law"},"about":[],"intro":[{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Legal issues"},{"text":"Evidence"},{"text":"Applicable law"},{"text":"Arguments"},{"text":"Relief sought"}]}],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"An NGT Litigator is a legal professional who handles environmental disputes and related proceedings before the National Green Tribunal (NGT) and, where appropriate, connected proceedings before constitutional courts and other authorities."},{"type":"p","text":"The work can involve:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Environmental clearances"},{"text":"Pollution-control matters"},{"text":"Industrial pollution"},{"text":"Forest and biodiversity issues"},{"text":"Waste management"},{"text":"Environmental compensation"},{"text":"Environmental damage"},{"text":"Sustainable development"},{"text":"Environmental impact assessment"},{"text":"Water and air pollution"},{"text":"Regulatory orders"},{"text":"Appeals against environmental decisions"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The career combines:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Law","Environmental Science","Litigation","Regulatory Compliance."],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Because environmental disputes often involve highly technical evidence, a successful environmental litigator needs more than legal knowledge. Understanding environmental science, pollution-control technologies, EIA processes, technical reports and scientific evidence is a major advantage."}]},{"heading":"Career Pathway","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"flow","items":["Class 12","LLB / Integrated Law Degree","Environmental Law","Environmental Law Internship","Litigation / Environmental Research","Junior Environmental Law Associate","NGT Litigation Experience","Environmental Litigator","Senior NGT Counsel / Environmental Law Specialist","Environmental Law Partner / Independent Counsel","Senior Environmental & Regulatory Advisor"]},{"type":"p","text":"A student can enter through:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Environmental law firms"},{"text":"Litigation chambers"},{"text":"NGOs"},{"text":"Environmental consultancies"},{"text":"Corporate environmental compliance teams"},{"text":"Government/regulatory organizations"},{"text":"Independent environmental-law practice"}]}]},{"heading":"What You Learn During LLB","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Legal Foundations"},{"type":"p","text":"Build a strong foundation in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Constitutional law"},{"text":"Contract law"},{"text":"Law of torts"},{"text":"Legal methods"},{"text":"Legal reasoning"},{"text":"Property law"},{"text":"Legal research"},{"text":"Legal writing"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Particularly Important"},{"type":"p","text":"Environmental litigation frequently intersects with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Constitutional rights"},{"text":"Administrative law"},{"text":"Tort principles"},{"text":"Public law"},{"text":"Regulatory law"}]}]},{"heading":"Year 2 — Environmental Law Foundation","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Study:"},{"type":"h","text":"Environmental Principles"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Sustainable development"},{"text":"Precautionary principle"},{"text":"Polluter pays principle"},{"text":"Intergenerational equity"},{"text":"Public trust doctrine"},{"text":"Environmental justice"},{"text":"Environmental impact assessment"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Environmental Regulation"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand the framework governing:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Air pollution"},{"text":"Water pollution"},{