diversity"},{"text":"Forest ecology"},{"text":"Climate change"},{"text":"Groundwater"},{"text":"Environmental impact assessment"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Pollution Concepts"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand common indicators such as:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"PM2.5"},{"text":"PM10"},{"text":"SO₂"},{"text":"NOx"},{"text":"BOD"},{"text":"COD"},{"text":"pH"},{"text":"Dissolved oxygen"},{"text":"Heavy metals"},{"text":"The goal is to understand what the technical evidence means and how it relates to the legal issue."}]}]},{"heading":"Environmental Impact Assessment","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"EIA is particularly important for environmental litigation."},{"type":"p","text":"Understand the broad process:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Project Proposal","Screening / Applicability","Scoping","Impact Assessment","Environmental Studies","Public Consultation where applicable","Expert / Regulatory Review","Environmental Clearance Decision","Compliance Monitoring"]},{"type":"p","text":"A litigator should be able to identify potential legal questions involving:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Environmental clearance"},{"text":"Conditions attached to approval"},{"text":"Public consultation"},{"text":"Environmental assessment"},{"text":"Compliance failures"},{"text":"Monitoring reports"},{"text":"Regulatory decisions"}]}]},{"heading":"Environmental Evidence","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Environmental litigation often relies on technical material."},{"type":"h","text":"Potential Evidence"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Laboratory reports"},{"text":"Pollution measurements"},{"text":"Environmental monitoring data"},{"text":"EIA reports"},{"text":"Expert reports"},{"text":"Government inspection reports"},{"text":"Satellite imagery"},{"text":"GIS data"},{"text":"Photographs"},{"text":"Water-quality data"},{"text":"Air-quality data"},{"text":"Waste records"},{"text":"Compliance reports"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The lawyer should understand:"},{"typ